          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 28,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "fdlLu",
              "name": "t2a",
              "fill": "#4CAF50",
              "content": "春秋时期（约前655年）",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 40,
              "fontWeight": "700"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "Eheb6",
              "name": "t2b",
              "fill": "#333333",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "晋国公子重耳流亡19年，随臣介子推割股奉君。重耳复国后封赏群臣，唯独忘了介子推。介子推携母隐居绵山，重耳放火烧山逼其出山，介子推抱树而死。",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 48,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "tanqZ",
              "name": "t2c",
              "fill": "#689F38",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "重耳悲痛，下令这一天禁火寒食\n这就是「寒食节」的由来\n后演变为清明节",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 44,
              "fontWeight": "600"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
